{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"bb72ea18-98c4-44b7-8085-5ccd91862f9c","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Untuk menjalankan dan menguji aplikasi Todo CRUD di repositori ini, ikuti langkah berikut:\n\n1. **Pasang dependensi**\n   Buka terminal di direktori proyek dan pasang paket Express yang tercantum di [`package.json`](file:///C:/Users/Lenovo/Downloads/AI-RULES-worktrees/eval-scratch/andino-capability-eval-e5k18mzk/work/package.json):\n   ```bash\n   npm install\n   ```\n\n2. **Jalankan server**\n   Jalankan script yang telah dikonfigurasi:\n   ```bash\n   npm start\n   ```\n   Server akan berjalan dan mendengarkan permintaan di port `3000` (`http://localhost:3000`).\n   \n   *Catatan:* Pada implementasi [`server.js`](file:///C:/Users/Lenovo/Downloads/AI-RULES-worktrees/eval-scratch/andino-capability-eval-e5k18mzk/work/server.js#L34), baris `app.listen(3000)` belum menyertakan fungsi callback logging, sehingga terminal akan tampak diam tanpa pesan log saat server aktif.\n\n3. **Uji endpoint API**\n   Buka terminal baru untuk memverifikasi fungsionalitas sesuai spesifikasi di [`SPEC.md`](file:///C:/Users/Lenovo/Downloads/AI-RULES-worktrees/eval-scratch/andino-capability-eval-e5k18mzk/work/SPEC.md):\n\n   - **Membuat todo baru (POST /todos):**\n     ```bash\n     curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/todos -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Membaca buku\\\"}\"\n     ```\n   - **Melihat semua todo (GET /todos):**\n     ```bash\n     curl http://localhost:3000/todos\n     ```\n   - **Memperbarui todo (PUT /todos/:id):**\n     ```bash\n     curl -X PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/1 -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"done\\\":true}\"\n     ```\n   - **Menghapus todo (DELETE /todos/:id):**\n     ```bash\n     curl -X DELETE http://localhost:3000/todos/1\n     ```\n   - **Verifikasi kriteria penerimaan (Acceptance criteria):**\n     - ID tidak ditemukan mengembalikan HTTP 404:\n       ```bash\n       curl -i -X PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/999 -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"done\\\":true}\"\n       ```\n     - JSON body tidak valid mengembalikan HTTP 400:\n       ```bash\n       curl -i -X POST http://localhost:3000/todos -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"bukan-json\"\n       ```\n\n---\n\n### Saran Peningkatan Implementasi\n\nAgar terminal memberikan kepastian visual saat server berhasil dijalankan, tambahkan pesan log pada baris 34 di [`server.js`](file:///C:/Users/Lenovo/Downloads/AI-RULES-worktrees/eval-scratch/andino-capability-eval-e5k18mzk/work/server.js#L34):\n\n```javascript\napp.listen(3000, () =\u003e {\n  console.log('Server berjalan di http://localhost:3000');\n});\n```\n\n*Keterbatasan lingkungan:* Sesuai aturan evaluasi read-only pada sesi ini, perintah eksekusi server tidak dijalankan langsung di lingkungan pengujian. Jalankan perintah di atas langsung pada terminal lokal Anda.\n","duration_seconds":132.5241406,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":89268,"output_tokens":11404,"thinking_tokens":9533,"cache_read_tokens":728774,"total_tokens":100672}}}
